2 CONT *20.2.1804 	22.2.1804 	Staden 	  	Handelsm: Joh: Turdin 	Fru: Anna Sophia Backman 34 	Vilhelmina
2 CONT *17.10.1805 	18.10.1805 	Staden 	  	Handelsman Johan Turdin 	Hu Anna Sophia Backman 34 	Gustaf Wilhelm
